(468598, 44818, 6388, '<td valign="top">you really capture the essence of Frank.  I sense the jutxtaposition of his need to live and his displeasure with his varicose facial veins.  and stuff. that and he looks hungry.  his body language suggests a subway roast chicken sub on parmesan oregano with chipotle sauce would be ideal.<br/>:D</td>', 'you really capture the essence of Frank.  I sense the jutxtaposition of his need to live and his displeasure with his varicose facial veins.  and stuff. that and he looks hungry.  his body language suggests a subway roast chicken sub on parmesan oregano with chipotle sauce would be ideal.:D', '2003-11-01 00:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
