(468623, 44693, 6388, '<td valign="top">the title gives it an extra point. did you use a flash or is there white on the mask?  if it''s white, never mind, if it''s a flash, either adjust your white balance for flash, or use a diffused light to get rid of the flares.  just a thought.<br/>Pedro</td>', 'the title gives it an extra point. did you use a flash or is there white on the mask?  if it''s white, never mind, if it''s a flash, either adjust your white balance for flash, or use a diffused light to get rid of the flares.  just a thought.Pedro', '2003-11-01 00:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(468624, 44748, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good job showing depth.</td>', 'Nice composition and good job showing depth.', '2003-11-01 00:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
