(468628, 44809, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice shade of green!  Seems to be a good amount of noise but it works well here!  Focus is a touch soft though.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice shade of green!  Seems to be a good amount of noise but it works well here!  Focus is a touch soft though.TC', '2003-11-01 00:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(468629, 44748, 6388, '<td valign="top">clearly stands out from the other pumpkin ones.  i like that you treated it like a normal photo (paying attention to technical aspects: composition, DOF etc). most are just snaps of a punkin.  good job.</td>', 'clearly stands out from the other pumpkin ones.  i like that you treated it like a normal photo (paying attention to technical aspects: composition, DOF etc). most are just snaps of a punkin.  good job.', '2003-11-01 00:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(468630, 44698, 6388, '<td valign="top">fabulous.  you''ll get hammered by the no-photoshopping people, but i like what you did to it. could be a video cover.</td>', 'fabulous.  you''ll get hammered by the no-photoshopping people, but i like what you did to it. could be a video cover.', '2003-11-01 00:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(468631, 44809, 10402, '<td valign="top">The blurriness, noise, eerie eyes, and spooky smile create a sinister mood. Good idea, but perhaps a bit overdone; I think a little less would have been more effective.</td>', 'The blurriness, noise, eerie eyes, and spooky smile create a sinister mood. Good idea, but perhaps a bit overdone; I think a little less would have been more effective.', '2003-11-01 00:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(468632, 44712, 3981, '<td valign="top">To me, this is the most clever of all the images.  I would have liked to see the background just a little lighter.  Great title for the photo! 8</td>', 'To me, this is the most clever of all the images.  I would have liked to see the background just a little lighter.  Great title for the photo! 8', '2003-11-01 00:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(468636, 44821, 10402, '<td valign="top">I assume this still life depicts Halloween traditions in Mexico. Not being acquainted with them, I don''t understand the symbolism this image seems to be so rich in, but it is certainly a treat for the eye. It makes me want to learn more about your traditions.</td>', 'I assume this still life depicts Halloween traditions in Mexico. Not being acquainted with them, I don''t understand the symbolism this image seems to be so rich in, but it is certainly a treat for the eye. It makes me want to learn more about your traditions.', '2003-11-01 00:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
