(468719, 44790, 10084, '<td valign="top">The grainy effect works perfectly with the B&amp;W shot. The good lighting gives the shot good contrast. Especially in the blade. It helps to show the sharpness of it. Love the red blood color on the end of the knife. Brings your eyes right toward it.<br/> <br/>Love the menacing eyes and the whole expression on the face. Very nice shot.</td>', 'The grainy effect works perfectly with the B&W shot. The good lighting gives the shot good contrast. Especially in the blade. It helps to show the sharpness of it. Love the red blood color on the end of the knife. Brings your eyes right toward it. Love the menacing eyes and the whole expression on the face. Very nice shot.', '2003-11-01 03:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
