(469252, 44684, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  But it doesn''t show HOW the Grinch stole Hallowe''en.  Maybe it should be called ''The Grinch That STOLE Hallowe''en''...  but it''s just my opinion....</td>', 'Nice shot!  But it doesn''t show HOW the Grinch stole Hallowe''en.  Maybe it should be called ''The Grinch That STOLE Hallowe''en''...  but it''s just my opinion....', '2003-11-01 14:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(469254, 44804, 4767, '<td valign="top">a pumpkin with personality!  Nice!</td>', 'a pumpkin with personality!  Nice!', '2003-11-01 14:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
