(469262, 44708, 4767, '<td valign="top">Where''s Casper?</td>', 'Where''s Casper?', '2003-11-01 14:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(469263, 44654, 4767, '<td valign="top">THIS is an eerie photo.  (Yeah, like you didn''t know, right?)   9</td>', 'THIS is an eerie photo.  (Yeah, like you didn''t know, right?)   9', '2003-11-01 14:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(469265, 44790, 4767, '<td valign="top">DAMN scary title!</td>', 'DAMN scary title!', '2003-11-01 14:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(469266, 44707, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice flames. Looks like a plastic pumpkin, so if it really burns, somebody''s in trouble!</td>', 'Nice flames. Looks like a plastic pumpkin, so if it really burns, somebody''s in trouble!', '2003-11-01 14:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(469267, 44838, 4767, '<td valign="top">Al the BEST portraits have a catchlight in the eyes, did you notice???</td>', 'Al the BEST portraits have a catchlight in the eyes, did you notice???', '2003-11-01 14:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(469281, 44837, 6504, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very good photo for the challenge, it''s spooky.   It''s dark and strange just as it should be.     I would like to know about the curtains.  They are beautiful!   Matter of fact,  I would like to see more of this room  It looks like something in a movie.</td>', 'I think this is a very good photo for the challenge, it''s spooky.   It''s dark and strange just as it should be.     I would like to know about the curtains.  They are beautiful!   Matter of fact,  I would like to see more of this room  It looks like something in a movie.', '2003-11-01 14:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(469282, 44727, 6668, '<td valign="top">Extremely grainy and the face is out of focus, also the lighting in the hair is kind of strange.</td>', 'Extremely grainy and the face is out of focus, also the lighting in the hair is kind of strange.', '2003-11-01 14:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(469283, 44818, 6504, '<td valign="top">Eeeeekkk!!!!   Scares the daylights out of me.  Should be in the top three winners.</td>', 'Eeeeekkk!!!!   Scares the daylights out of me.  Should be in the top three winners.', '2003-11-01 14:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(469285, 44827, 6504, '<td valign="top">The points in the head, the teeth, the ears, eyebrows. yikes.   This is excellent.</td>', 'The points in the head, the teeth, the ears, eyebrows. yikes.   This is excellent.', '2003-11-01 14:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(469286, 44684, 6504, '<td valign="top">I usuallly don''t care for stuffed animal shots, but this is so well done, I think it makes a very good photo.  Especially the rotting teeth.   The lighting is very good, compostion excellent.</td>', 'I usuallly don''t care for stuffed animal shots, but this is so well done, I think it makes a very good photo.  Especially the rotting teeth.   The lighting is very good, compostion excellent.', '2003-11-01 14:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(469288, 44693, 6504, '<td valign="top">Ohmygawd.  I am a mother in law and this is how I think my daughter in law might see me.  The nose is great, the title is the best!!   Good clear photo with good lighting.   I like that you chose the close up.</td>', 'Ohmygawd.  I am a mother in law and this is how I think my daughter in law might see me.  The nose is great, the title is the best!!   Good clear photo with good lighting.   I like that you chose the close up.', '2003-11-01 14:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(469289, 44826, 6504, '<td valign="top">The Funniest photo I have ever seen on here.  This looks like a good spirited man,  enjoying the whole thing.  Great capture.  I love the crossed legs, and hands.  Makes me want to sit down and drink a cup of coffe and have a good chuckle with him</td>', 'The Funniest photo I have ever seen on here.  This looks like a good spirited man,  enjoying the whole thing.  Great capture.  I love the crossed legs, and hands.  Makes me want to sit down and drink a cup of coffe and have a good chuckle with him', '2003-11-01 14:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(469290, 44705, 6504, '<td valign="top">ooohhh, scary!!!!    I think this should finish on top.   I hope you will reveal later how you did it.</td>', 'ooohhh, scary!!!!    I think this should finish on top.   I hope you will reveal later how you did it.', '2003-11-01 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(469302, 44658, 6668, '<td valign="top">seems a bit grainy.</td>', 'seems a bit grainy.', '2003-11-01 15:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(469308, 44807, 6668, '<td valign="top">Cool shot...the toothpicks kind of take away from the overall effect but obviously they were necessary, love the lighting and the colors! 8</td>', 'Cool shot...the toothpicks kind of take away from the overall effect but obviously they were necessary, love the lighting and the colors! 8', '2003-11-01 15:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(469309, 44803, 6668, '<td valign="top">Wow...great shot..love the colors the smoke the border everything...I predict a winner..hope to see this one at the top. 10!</td>', 'Wow...great shot..love the colors the smoke the border everything...I predict a winner..hope to see this one at the top. 10!', '2003-11-01 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(469310, 44827, 6668, '<td valign="top">Great shot...would be much better without the red border in my opinion. 8</td>', 'Great shot...would be much better without the red border in my opinion. 8', '2003-11-01 15:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(469312, 44820, 6668, '<td valign="top">The words on the photo take away from the shot in my opinion...also the border is to tight, it is cutting off the letters on the top.</td>', 'The words on the photo take away from the shot in my opinion...also the border is to tight, it is cutting off the letters on the top.', '2003-11-01 15:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(469313, 44788, 6668, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the connection between the title and the photo...is that where she is going?</td>', 'I don''t get the connection between the title and the photo...is that where she is going?', '2003-11-01 15:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(469314, 44758, 6668, '<td valign="top">Love the cat face on the pumpkin...will be looking forward to seeing how this was done when the challenge is over...by the way that looks almost exactly like my cat! :-)</td>', 'Love the cat face on the pumpkin...will be looking forward to seeing how this was done when the challenge is over...by the way that looks almost exactly like my cat! :-)', '2003-11-01 15:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
