(469399, 44654, 11738, '<td valign="top">That looks sooo weird!  The skin texture is out of this world.  Sort of looks like he''s being attacked by a cake knife though.  This image would have had even more impact if you could have pushed that skin/applesauce colour and replaced it with a blood red colour.</td>', 'That looks sooo weird!  The skin texture is out of this world.  Sort of looks like he''s being attacked by a cake knife though.  This image would have had even more impact if you could have pushed that skin/applesauce colour and replaced it with a blood red colour.', '2003-11-01 17:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
