(469467, 44844, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes it is, where there is light there is CANDY!  Nice idea, good concept on Halloween and having the door nice and sharp with the rest a bit blurred out is very good, either that or it was really windy but at the same time it''s a bit distracting.  An 8 to start</td>', 'Yes it is, where there is light there is CANDY!  Nice idea, good concept on Halloween and having the door nice and sharp with the rest a bit blurred out is very good, either that or it was really windy but at the same time it''s a bit distracting.  An 8 to start', '2003-11-01 19:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(469470, 44816, 12448, '<td valign="top">In the thumbnail this looks black and orange but once you get here it''s more gray, if the lines around the mouth and eyes were just a tad more defined this would be a 9 or 10 for me.  Just a bit too much blur for me.  An 8 :)</td>', 'In the thumbnail this looks black and orange but once you get here it''s more gray, if the lines around the mouth and eyes were just a tad more defined this would be a 9 or 10 for me.  Just a bit too much blur for me.  An 8 :)', '2003-11-01 19:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(469472, 44838, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice shot of Dracula but the stars in his eyes really go against the rest of the display, I''m thinking they were inserted?  The actual use of cloth for a cap was a wonderful touch for the person who did this display.  The red lights in the back are a bit distracting.  A 6 to start</td>', 'A nice shot of Dracula but the stars in his eyes really go against the rest of the display, I''m thinking they were inserted?  The actual use of cloth for a cap was a wonderful touch for the person who did this display.  The red lights in the back are a bit distracting.  A 6 to start', '2003-11-01 19:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(469477, 44827, 12223, '<td valign="top">9. Well done.  Border works. Strong image.</td>', '9. Well done.  Border works. Strong image.', '2003-11-01 19:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
