(471519, 44759, 10084, '<td valign="top">Vertical composition works well. Beautiful orange halo around the subject. The framing works perfectly with the shot. This would make for a great door poster or bookmark. Very nice.</td>', 'Vertical composition works well. Beautiful orange halo around the subject. The framing works perfectly with the shot. This would make for a great door poster or bookmark. Very nice.', '2003-11-03 20:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(471525, 44806, 10084, '<td valign="top">Lighting really helps to give a creepy mood to the shot. Love the effects with the ghostly hands. I like how the hand on the lower left also has a shadow. it''s wonderful. Nice work.</td>', 'Lighting really helps to give a creepy mood to the shot. Love the effects with the ghostly hands. I like how the hand on the lower left also has a shadow. it''s wonderful. Nice work.', '2003-11-03 20:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(471527, 44846, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and good exacution on the idea.  Just one thing that really kind of bothers me and the is the persons clothing.  The colors or the stripes, not sure which but I find it distracting and trying to take over the shot and pulling you away from the overall effect you might have been going for.  I would have gone for something white or solid color, more muted.  A 6 to start</td>', 'Interesting idea and good exacution on the idea.  Just one thing that really kind of bothers me and the is the persons clothing.  The colors or the stripes, not sure which but I find it distracting and trying to take over the shot and pulling you away from the overall effect you might have been going for.  I would have gone for something white or solid color, more muted.  A 6 to start', '2003-11-03 20:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(471529, 44672, 12448, '<td valign="top">No he''s not, is he?  :)  He reminds me of an Ewok from Star Wars but I have to be honest, his eyes are just a little spooky, almost like, "If you take one more picture of me, so help me I won''t be responsible for my actions" type look, LOL!  Amazing what the camera will catch.  This is a loverly shot overall, the black and white works very well, the cropping is just a tad tight to me but overall a wonderful shot.  A 9</td>', 'No he''s not, is he?  :)  He reminds me of an Ewok from Star Wars but I have to be honest, his eyes are just a little spooky, almost like, "If you take one more picture of me, so help me I won''t be responsible for my actions" type look, LOL!  Amazing what the camera will catch.  This is a loverly shot overall, the black and white works very well, the cropping is just a tad tight to me but overall a wonderful shot.  A 9', '2003-11-03 20:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(471532, 44801, 12448, '<td valign="top">eek?!  He can almost pull this look off.  The eyes are wonderful, the look really looks almost undead.  Almost a teenager? :)  Just kidding.  I like the idea, if the shot was a bit sharper around the mouth and you could actually see the fangs it would work much better for me personally.  Also, when I think vampires (I''m guessing that''s what he is because of the title) I think very pale and anemic.  He is more like a zombie to me and I guess they go for blood to so that would work also.  An 8</td>', 'eek?!  He can almost pull this look off.  The eyes are wonderful, the look really looks almost undead.  Almost a teenager? :)  Just kidding.  I like the idea, if the shot was a bit sharper around the mouth and you could actually see the fangs it would work much better for me personally.  Also, when I think vampires (I''m guessing that''s what he is because of the title) I think very pale and anemic.  He is more like a zombie to me and I guess they go for blood to so that would work also.  An 8', '2003-11-03 20:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(471537, 44699, 12448, '<td valign="top">That looks like it would hurt!  HOW DID SHE DO THAT?  LOL!  Nice idea, good concept but the PS on the right side really hurts the shot to me, her left ear almost looks vulcan without playing with it and the arch of her eyebrow is very natural and would have worked very well.  If you had left the right side alone this would have been a 9 or 10 for me before I was done, as is, a 7</td>', 'That looks like it would hurt!  HOW DID SHE DO THAT?  LOL!  Nice idea, good concept but the PS on the right side really hurts the shot to me, her left ear almost looks vulcan without playing with it and the arch of her eyebrow is very natural and would have worked very well.  If you had left the right side alone this would have been a 9 or 10 for me before I was done, as is, a 7', '2003-11-03 20:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(471539, 44837, 12448, '<td valign="top">So have I, it really can be spooky, ya know?  This is a great idea, the overall shot was well done but the left side is a tad dark for me, might have been cropped a little more?    Also if there was any way you could have seen the face of the dead person a little better?  A 7</td>', 'So have I, it really can be spooky, ya know?  This is a great idea, the overall shot was well done but the left side is a tad dark for me, might have been cropped a little more?    Also if there was any way you could have seen the face of the dead person a little better?  A 7', '2003-11-03 21:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
