(471992, 44803, 12448, '<td valign="top">I can see the skull but that''s about it, not sure what the rest is.  The overall shot is well done, the smoke effect is very nice.  The white border is a bit distracting.  A 7 to start</td>', 'I can see the skull but that''s about it, not sure what the rest is.  The overall shot is well done, the smoke effect is very nice.  The white border is a bit distracting.  A 7 to start', '2003-11-04 12:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(471993, 44809, 12448, '<td valign="top">Huh, not really sure what to say.  I don''t really get the efeect of a alien, just an girl friend who is helping you have fun, maybe if didn''t look quite so happy?  The fuzzieness hurts this picture and the coloration doesn''t really help either.  A 3</td>', 'Huh, not really sure what to say.  I don''t really get the efeect of a alien, just an girl friend who is helping you have fun, maybe if didn''t look quite so happy?  The fuzzieness hurts this picture and the coloration doesn''t really help either.  A 3', '2003-11-04 12:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(471998, 44767, 12448, '<td valign="top">How cute!  Hope he had a lot of fun!  As for the shot, the cropping is a little tight, cutting off the top of his head hurts the shot though I do like the off center of the shot.  An 8 to start</td>', 'How cute!  Hope he had a lot of fun!  As for the shot, the cropping is a little tight, cutting off the top of his head hurts the shot though I do like the off center of the shot.  An 8 to start', '2003-11-04 12:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(472001, 44725, 12448, '<td valign="top">The concept is good, the shot itself leaves me wanting.  The old look, the scratches and the pumpkin just don''t appeal to me overall.  Perhaps if you had gone with the colored version?  A 5</td>', 'The concept is good, the shot itself leaves me wanting.  The old look, the scratches and the pumpkin just don''t appeal to me overall.  Perhaps if you had gone with the colored version?  A 5', '2003-11-04 12:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(472004, 44647, 12448, '<td valign="top">Cobwebs and chains!  Perfect Halloween idea.  But there is too much negative space and if the shadow of the chain was more defined.  A 5</td>', 'Cobwebs and chains!  Perfect Halloween idea.  But there is too much negative space and if the shadow of the chain was more defined.  A 5', '2003-11-04 12:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(472010, 44810, 12448, '<td valign="top">Rather spooky but too red for me personally.  Maybe if the skull was more defined and white?  A 6</td>', 'Rather spooky but too red for me personally.  Maybe if the skull was more defined and white?  A 6', '2003-11-04 12:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(472013, 44823, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes, you have hit all the elements of the holiday.  The ghost, the pumpkin and the black cat :)  The shot itself though leave me wanting.  Maybe if all three were closer together?  The space between them is very distracting and the shadow cast by the pumpkin also detracts from the shot.  I like the stand it''s on though!  A 6</td>', 'Yes, you have hit all the elements of the holiday.  The ghost, the pumpkin and the black cat :)  The shot itself though leave me wanting.  Maybe if all three were closer together?  The space between them is very distracting and the shadow cast by the pumpkin also detracts from the shot.  I like the stand it''s on though!  A 6', '2003-11-04 12:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(472015, 44776, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yum!!!  My three favorites, if you had included kit kats you would have gotten extra points just for that! ;)  The shot is well thought out, well composed and the lighting is close to perfect, a tad lighter and it would be perfect for me.  The DOF works very well in this shot but the cropping and angle could be just slight different and this would be a 10 for me.  As is an 8</td>', 'Yum!!!  My three favorites, if you had included kit kats you would have gotten extra points just for that! ;)  The shot is well thought out, well composed and the lighting is close to perfect, a tad lighter and it would be perfect for me.  The DOF works very well in this shot but the cropping and angle could be just slight different and this would be a 10 for me.  As is an 8', '2003-11-04 12:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(472017, 44756, 12448, '<td valign="top">YIKES! :)  Very frightening thought, glad I didn''t let my kids go out this year! LOL  Unique idea, points for that alone but the shot itself, the cropping could have been tighter on the right, the stairs are distracting  and the stark white on the left also draws you out.  The contrast could be brought up just a tad and this would almost perfect.  A 7</td>', 'YIKES! :)  Very frightening thought, glad I didn''t let my kids go out this year! LOL  Unique idea, points for that alone but the shot itself, the cropping could have been tighter on the right, the stairs are distracting  and the stark white on the left also draws you out.  The contrast could be brought up just a tad and this would almost perfect.  A 7', '2003-11-04 12:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(472018, 44708, 12448, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwww, how cute!  I want a little ghost!  Very cool idea for the challenge, I love it.  The light could be a little brighter, really make the white pop out at you but the cropping and angle is very good, takes you from corner to corner.  An 8</td>', 'Awwwwwww, how cute!  I want a little ghost!  Very cool idea for the challenge, I love it.  The light could be a little brighter, really make the white pop out at you but the cropping and angle is very good, takes you from corner to corner.  An 8', '2003-11-04 12:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(472020, 44710, 12448, '<td valign="top">Gimme!!!!! :)  Very cute idea, the smoke takes away from the shot though, and the blurriness of the front ghost is a bit distracting.  a 7</td>', 'Gimme!!!!! :)  Very cute idea, the smoke takes away from the shot though, and the blurriness of the front ghost is a bit distracting.  a 7', '2003-11-04 12:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(472023, 44732, 12448, '<td valign="top">Sparkly!!!  I love sparkles! ;)  A very cute idea, the lighting in the shot is just about perfect and the cropping is well done.  The border really adds to the shot, a 9</td>', 'Sparkly!!!  I love sparkles! ;)  A very cute idea, the lighting in the shot is just about perfect and the cropping is well done.  The border really adds to the shot, a 9', '2003-11-04 12:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(472024, 44758, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''ve looked at this shot a couple of times and just noticed for the first time the cat face on the pumpkin itself!  Wonder how many people have missed that.  This is a good shot, I love the idea, the coloration, black and orange, traditional, the cat chewing on the pumpkin.  But now that I''ve noticed the face in the pumpkin I can''t take my eyes off of it.  It''s become a distraction :(  A 9</td>', 'Wow, I''ve looked at this shot a couple of times and just noticed for the first time the cat face on the pumpkin itself!  Wonder how many people have missed that.  This is a good shot, I love the idea, the coloration, black and orange, traditional, the cat chewing on the pumpkin.  But now that I''ve noticed the face in the pumpkin I can''t take my eyes off of it.  It''s become a distraction :(  A 9', '2003-11-04 12:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(472036, 44732, 12194, '<td valign="top">Cool colors and reflections!  10</td>', 'Cool colors and reflections!  10', '2003-11-04 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(472047, 44769, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea and the shot itself is well done.  The blurriness adds and detracts from the shot, the top of the bottle should be but the bottom should be a bit sharper to me.  The negative space use is well done, a 7</td>', 'Very cool idea and the shot itself is well done.  The blurriness adds and detracts from the shot, the top of the bottle should be but the bottom should be a bit sharper to me.  The negative space use is well done, a 7', '2003-11-04 13:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(472049, 44752, 12448, '<td valign="top">Magnets?  That''s what I''m guessing.  The pattern of colors is nice and the edges are very smooth yet defined.  Well done.  The setting up of the shot seems off for some reason, can''t quite put my finger on it and the upper left looks a bit blown out.  A 7</td>', 'Magnets?  That''s what I''m guessing.  The pattern of colors is nice and the edges are very smooth yet defined.  Well done.  The setting up of the shot seems off for some reason, can''t quite put my finger on it and the upper left looks a bit blown out.  A 7', '2003-11-04 13:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(472050, 44778, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good idea and the lighting is perfect.  The cropping seems a bit off, the right eyebrow got cut off and the focus could use just a tad help.  A 7</td>', 'Nice shot, good idea and the lighting is perfect.  The cropping seems a bit off, the right eyebrow got cut off and the focus could use just a tad help.  A 7', '2003-11-04 13:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(472051, 44790, 12448, '<td valign="top">Is that a child in the shot?  The hand looks so small!  The idea is well done but the shot really leaves me wanting, the grain really takes away from teh overall shot, maybe if the knife was smoother and more focused this would work much better.  A 5</td>', 'Is that a child in the shot?  The hand looks so small!  The idea is well done but the shot really leaves me wanting, the grain really takes away from teh overall shot, maybe if the knife was smoother and more focused this would work much better.  A 5', '2003-11-04 13:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(472054, 44661, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get the idea from the title but the blue in the window offers a very eerie feeling to the shot but the angle, the cropping and the rest of the shot really hurts more than helps.  Possibly a tighter crop?  A 5</td>', 'Not sure I get the idea from the title but the blue in the window offers a very eerie feeling to the shot but the angle, the cropping and the rest of the shot really hurts more than helps.  Possibly a tighter crop?  A 5', '2003-11-04 13:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(472059, 44684, 12448, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the angle really doesn''t do anything for me.  THe clarity and colors are wonderful and the evil look is perfect for the holiday.  An 8</td>', 'Good idea, but the angle really doesn''t do anything for me.  THe clarity and colors are wonderful and the evil look is perfect for the holiday.  An 8', '2003-11-04 13:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(472084, 44800, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not really :)  Good idea but the cropping and the shot itself leaves me wanting, I can''t quite explain it.  Maybe the light is a tad bright, the colors a bit to bright, just not sure.  The bold is distracting but does let you know who it is.  A 7</td>', 'Not really :)  Good idea but the cropping and the shot itself leaves me wanting, I can''t quite explain it.  Maybe the light is a tad bright, the colors a bit to bright, just not sure.  The bold is distracting but does let you know who it is.  A 7', '2003-11-04 13:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(472088, 44684, 7304, '<td valign="top">Love the angle of the mask. Great color. Nice and sharp. I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Love the angle of the mask. Great color. Nice and sharp. I gave it an 8.', '2003-11-04 13:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(472090, 44743, 12448, '<td valign="top">The shot is well done overall but the post processing isn''t to my taste.   Never have been a big bas relief fan :)  The corpping the trees, the cross all really add to the shot and gives you  a very good sense of the holiday.  A 7</td>', 'The shot is well done overall but the post processing isn''t to my taste.   Never have been a big bas relief fan :)  The corpping the trees, the cross all really add to the shot and gives you  a very good sense of the holiday.  A 7', '2003-11-04 13:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(472092, 44827, 7304, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice make-up job. I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice make-up job. I gave it a 7.', '2003-11-04 13:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(472095, 44748, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and a fun shot. Border helps frame the pumpkins. I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Nice shot and a fun shot. Border helps frame the pumpkins. I gave it a 7.', '2003-11-04 13:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
