(472196, 44837, 13761, '<td valign="top">i think the picture is very scaaary, i think i know the actress, she''s gorgeous, smart, and a hell of a dancer, so i hear. I also have to say i love the holders for the curtains. I would give this picture 10 out of 10<br/></td>', 'i think the picture is very scaaary, i think i know the actress, she''s gorgeous, smart, and a hell of a dancer, so i hear. I also have to say i love the holders for the curtains. I would give this picture 10 out of 10', '2003-11-04 15:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
