(473035, 44799, 13403, '<td valign="top">god i love strongbad..   but what is this..  if you look at it the way i am seeing it.. the angled slits near the top look like eyes.. the broad middle top is a nose.. and the half crescents on either side are cheekbones..  you can see a mean lower lip sticking out and a very defined chin underneath..  this looks nothing at all like strongbad.   but kudos just the same :)  this hooded ninja is all the better.</td>', 'god i love strongbad..   but what is this..  if you look at it the way i am seeing it.. the angled slits near the top look like eyes.. the broad middle top is a nose.. and the half crescents on either side are cheekbones..  you can see a mean lower lip sticking out and a very defined chin underneath..  this looks nothing at all like strongbad.   but kudos just the same :)  this hooded ninja is all the better.', '2003-11-05 03:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
