(473901, 44811, 13844, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful.', '2003-11-05 13:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(473933, 44752, 6008, '<td valign="top">This looks entirely photoshopped to me with no photography whatsoever.</td>', 'This looks entirely photoshopped to me with no photography whatsoever.', '2003-11-05 13:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(473936, 44661, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image is a little dark and the roof seems tilted. I''m not sure if it''s the blue window or what looks like two beady eyes or a mixture of both that''s the focal point. It also seems a little blurry, probably due to the low light conditions.</td>', 'The image is a little dark and the roof seems tilted. I''m not sure if it''s the blue window or what looks like two beady eyes or a mixture of both that''s the focal point. It also seems a little blurry, probably due to the low light conditions.', '2003-11-05 13:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(473943, 44727, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image looks quite blurry, probably due to the low light conditions. It''s also fairly dark with a yellow cast.</td>', 'The image looks quite blurry, probably due to the low light conditions. It''s also fairly dark with a yellow cast.', '2003-11-05 13:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(473948, 44831, 6008, '<td valign="top">This probably would have been much better had it been sharper, and possibly having the eye a little further back from the opening. The catchlight in the eye is good, as is the composition.</td>', 'This probably would have been much better had it been sharper, and possibly having the eye a little further back from the opening. The catchlight in the eye is good, as is the composition.', '2003-11-05 14:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(473954, 44826, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting candid, and yes that''s scary. Other than completing changing everything, I dont really see anything you could improve. It is what it is.</td>', 'Interesting candid, and yes that''s scary. Other than completing changing everything, I dont really see anything you could improve. It is what it is.', '2003-11-05 14:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(473960, 44796, 6008, '<td valign="top">Had it been a less edited face I think it would have looked better. I liked the foreground with the ivy and the brick, but I''m not sure about the head. Is it suppose to be a small troll-like creature? If so the perspective/size of the head is too big. If the person is suppose to be full-size and standing near a wall then the foreground gives the illusion of it being the ground and thus the person standing there seems at odd height. I think I can see what you were aiming for, I just think it could have been tweaked a little more to attain it.</td>', 'Had it been a less edited face I think it would have looked better. I liked the foreground with the ivy and the brick, but I''m not sure about the head. Is it suppose to be a small troll-like creature? If so the perspective/size of the head is too big. If the person is suppose to be full-size and standing near a wall then the foreground gives the illusion of it being the ground and thus the person standing there seems at odd height. I think I can see what you were aiming for, I just think it could have been tweaked a little more to attain it.', '2003-11-05 14:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(473962, 44654, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to say about this one. It''s rather gross in a pus-covered way. You seem to have forgot to add the effect on the other eye and cheek beyond the knife.</td>', 'Not sure what to say about this one. It''s rather gross in a pus-covered way. You seem to have forgot to add the effect on the other eye and cheek beyond the knife.', '2003-11-05 14:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(473966, 44824, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of the head in the frame. Unless this is an edited skull x-ray it seems very photoshoped to a point where I dont see much photography. This is certainly a classic subject for halloween.</td>', 'I like the angle of the head in the frame. Unless this is an edited skull x-ray it seems very photoshoped to a point where I dont see much photography. This is certainly a classic subject for halloween.', '2003-11-05 14:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(473969, 44743, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a fan of the editing here but I can see how you may have wanted the white lines to appear as ghostly shapes. The position of the cross is good, and had the editing not been done I''m sure this would have looked like quite a good spooky cemetery shot.</td>', 'I''m not really a fan of the editing here but I can see how you may have wanted the white lines to appear as ghostly shapes. The position of the cross is good, and had the editing not been done I''m sure this would have looked like quite a good spooky cemetery shot.', '2003-11-05 14:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(473974, 44792, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting candid. I''m sure that haircut is a horror for someone.</td>', 'Interesting candid. I''m sure that haircut is a horror for someone.', '2003-11-05 14:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(473978, 44816, 6008, '<td valign="top">Appropriate subject for the challenge. There are a few areas that could have been cloned out but other than that I dont really see any areas to improve on.</td>', 'Appropriate subject for the challenge. There are a few areas that could have been cloned out but other than that I dont really see any areas to improve on.', '2003-11-05 14:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(473980, 44780, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image is certainly warped, although not so sure about the choice of colors.</td>', 'The image is certainly warped, although not so sure about the choice of colors.', '2003-11-05 14:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(473983, 44658, 6008, '<td valign="top">The expression is cute. A little soft, probably due to the low light conditions. I may have liked to have seen a little of the shape of the pumpkin or the ''face'' part just for some definition but it works as is. No obvious signs of editing, which is good!</td>', 'The expression is cute. A little soft, probably due to the low light conditions. I may have liked to have seen a little of the shape of the pumpkin or the ''face'' part just for some definition but it works as is. No obvious signs of editing, which is good!', '2003-11-05 14:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(473988, 44647, 6008, '<td valign="top">There isnt really much to see here, although I think that could be a chain and some cobwebs. I would have liked a larger area maybe, but it does well at making the viewer want to know what else is there hidding in the shadows.</td>', 'There isnt really much to see here, although I think that could be a chain and some cobwebs. I would have liked a larger area maybe, but it does well at making the viewer want to know what else is there hidding in the shadows.', '2003-11-05 14:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(473990, 44721, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting subject but for my personal tastes I think there is too much obvious editing that distracts. Granted it''s not the worse editing job I''ve seen, but I think the better editing is when it isnt so obvious.</td>', 'It''s an interesting subject but for my personal tastes I think there is too much obvious editing that distracts. Granted it''s not the worse editing job I''ve seen, but I think the better editing is when it isnt so obvious.', '2003-11-05 14:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(474176, 44756, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and I could well imagine people going on a murdering spree from all that sugar consumed. The door frame is slanted, but I think that adds to the chaos of the scene. And it''s a little dark in places, but again, I can see how that fits well with the theme.</td>', 'Interesting idea and I could well imagine people going on a murdering spree from all that sugar consumed. The door frame is slanted, but I think that adds to the chaos of the scene. And it''s a little dark in places, but again, I can see how that fits well with the theme.', '2003-11-05 16:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(474181, 44809, 6008, '<td valign="top">The night vision look does add a little big of spookiness to the image, especially with those eyes and that wide grin. Nothing really to improve on as I believe what you have is probably the exact effect you were going for.</td>', 'The night vision look does add a little big of spookiness to the image, especially with those eyes and that wide grin. Nothing really to improve on as I believe what you have is probably the exact effect you were going for.', '2003-11-05 16:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(474188, 44823, 6008, '<td valign="top">You have all the elements of a halloween night - the pumpkin, someone dressed up, and a black cat. The light on the pumpkin is a little too bright, having indirect light or playing with curves could have helped, but also as this challenge was full editing you could have tried some dodge and burn. The cat''s ear obscures the girl''s face a little, ideally it would have been better had you fully seen her face.</td>', 'You have all the elements of a halloween night - the pumpkin, someone dressed up, and a black cat. The light on the pumpkin is a little too bright, having indirect light or playing with curves could have helped, but also as this challenge was full editing you could have tried some dodge and burn. The cat''s ear obscures the girl''s face a little, ideally it would have been better had you fully seen her face.', '2003-11-05 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(474191, 44710, 6008, '<td valign="top">Cute, although I think the smoke/clouds/fog at the bottom overpower the lower ghosts a little. The ones at the top are darker and have more contrast and as such stand out more.</td>', 'Cute, although I think the smoke/clouds/fog at the bottom overpower the lower ghosts a little. The ones at the top are darker and have more contrast and as such stand out more.', '2003-11-05 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(474193, 44819, 6008, '<td valign="top">The red sky is good, reminds me of blood red skies you seen in horror movies. Unfortunately, probably due to the low light, the silhouettes are blurry and as such the overal effect is somewhat lost. It still remains a spooky quality to it.</td>', 'The red sky is good, reminds me of blood red skies you seen in horror movies. Unfortunately, probably due to the low light, the silhouettes are blurry and as such the overal effect is somewhat lost. It still remains a spooky quality to it.', '2003-11-05 16:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(474197, 44843, 6008, '<td valign="top">Although I''m not a fan of most PS filters, i think this is effective to show the dizzy spinning that comes with eating too much candy. The lighting on the candy wrappers is good, although the lollipop stick is a little on the bright side. The effect is also not overpowering, which is good.</td>', 'Although I''m not a fan of most PS filters, i think this is effective to show the dizzy spinning that comes with eating too much candy. The lighting on the candy wrappers is good, although the lollipop stick is a little on the bright side. The effect is also not overpowering, which is good.', '2003-11-05 16:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(474203, 44799, 6008, '<td valign="top">Slightly burry but you can see what it is suppose to represent. I like how it also shows the outline and not just the inner features. The gradient of red/yellow in the carvings is good also. It seems a little lost in the black, tho, and I think having a cloer-up shot that fills the frame would probably have been more effective.</td>', 'Slightly burry but you can see what it is suppose to represent. I like how it also shows the outline and not just the inner features. The gradient of red/yellow in the carvings is good also. It seems a little lost in the black, tho, and I think having a cloer-up shot that fills the frame would probably have been more effective.', '2003-11-05 16:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(474208, 44768, 6008, '<td valign="top">Composition is fine, lighting is good, focus is ok. It''s certainly spooky and apropriate for the halloween challenge.</td>', 'Composition is fine, lighting is good, focus is ok. It''s certainly spooky and apropriate for the halloween challenge.', '2003-11-05 16:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(474215, 44800, 6008, '<td valign="top">Lighting is ok, although there is a small area on the bolt that seems to be a little too bright. Compositionally, I''m not sure why you decided to crop out part of the face. It meets the challenge of being associated with halloween but as it appears to be a mask or prop there doesnt seem to be much ''wow'' factor.</td>', 'Lighting is ok, although there is a small area on the bolt that seems to be a little too bright. Compositionally, I''m not sure why you decided to crop out part of the face. It meets the challenge of being associated with halloween but as it appears to be a mask or prop there doesnt seem to be much ''wow'' factor.', '2003-11-05 16:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(474221, 44818, 6008, '<td valign="top">It seems a little blurry around the top of his head, but that could be because of the blue shadow. It''s an appropriate image for the halloween challenge. The lighting looks ok, and other than the white in the lower right corner that could probably have been cropped out, the composition is ok too.</td>', 'It seems a little blurry around the top of his head, but that could be because of the blue shadow. It''s an appropriate image for the halloween challenge. The lighting looks ok, and other than the white in the lower right corner that could probably have been cropped out, the composition is ok too.', '2003-11-05 16:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(474232, 44732, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the gradient background and of course the reflections are good too. This is a fairly happy halloween pic, which there is nothing wrong with that! The exposure is good considering those pumpkins are usually fairly bright, and they are also fairly sharp. The matching border is good too.</td>', 'I like the gradient background and of course the reflections are good too. This is a fairly happy halloween pic, which there is nothing wrong with that! The exposure is good considering those pumpkins are usually fairly bright, and they are also fairly sharp. The matching border is good too.', '2003-11-05 16:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(474236, 44707, 6008, '<td valign="top">There is an interesting texture and translucent luminosity to the pumpkin, certainly not one normally seen. It almost looks like it was photoshop created. The red glow is good, it''s not too dark and not too bright. It''s very close-up and shows the details well.</td>', 'There is an interesting texture and translucent luminosity to the pumpkin, certainly not one normally seen. It almost looks like it was photoshop created. The red glow is good, it''s not too dark and not too bright. It''s very close-up and shows the details well.', '2003-11-05 16:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(474388, 44821, 12792, '<td valign="top">Colorful and off-beat (at least for me).  Great idea and great image!</td>', 'Colorful and off-beat (at least for me).  Great idea and great image!', '2003-11-05 18:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(474390, 44796, 12792, '<td valign="top">Fun!  I like the balance and the idea.</td>', 'Fun!  I like the balance and the idea.', '2003-11-05 18:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(474392, 44705, 12792, '<td valign="top">Cool!  Good idea and very good execution.</td>', 'Cool!  Good idea and very good execution.', '2003-11-05 18:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(474396, 44769, 12792, '<td valign="top">I like the image, though I''m not certain what is in the image.  Being a bit of a contrast freak (I like it), I really like the overall feel.</td>', 'I like the image, though I''m not certain what is in the image.  Being a bit of a contrast freak (I like it), I really like the overall feel.', '2003-11-05 18:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(474403, 44807, 12792, '<td valign="top">Wow... who sez simple can''t be fun!  I love the idea, presentation and execution.  The orange and yellow against pitch black really does it for me.  Great work!</td>', 'Wow... who sez simple can''t be fun!  I love the idea, presentation and execution.  The orange and yellow against pitch black really does it for me.  Great work!', '2003-11-05 18:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(474404, 44802, 12792, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, well executed.  Diner is served!</td>', 'Fun idea, well executed.  Diner is served!', '2003-11-05 18:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(474407, 44778, 12792, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I''m not sure it''s dark enough for me.  Good work though</td>', 'Good idea, but I''m not sure it''s dark enough for me.  Good work though', '2003-11-05 18:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(474410, 44672, 12792, '<td valign="top">Ahhh....  Cute kid and fun costum.  Very professional looking portrait, well executed.  I''m not sure that it''s as "Halloween" enough, at least compared to many of the other entries.   Nice work, though.</td>', 'Ahhh....  Cute kid and fun costum.  Very professional looking portrait, well executed.  I''m not sure that it''s as "Halloween" enough, at least compared to many of the other entries.   Nice work, though.', '2003-11-05 18:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(474411, 44748, 12792, '<td valign="top">Fun colors and great finished product.</td>', 'Fun colors and great finished product.', '2003-11-05 18:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(474413, 44743, 12792, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it doesn''t do it for me, at least for the "spirit" (sorry couldn''t resist) of this challenge.  I like the idea and the execution, but my taste tends towards the "real" unreality of many of the other submissions. Good work and good luck.<br/>Note: Ive not marked down for the effects.<br/></td>', 'Good idea, but it doesn''t do it for me, at least for the "spirit" (sorry couldn''t resist) of this challenge.  I like the idea and the execution, but my taste tends towards the "real" unreality of many of the other submissions. Good work and good luck.Note: Ive not marked down for the effects.', '2003-11-05 18:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(474415, 44798, 12792, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and fun make-up.</td>', 'Good lighting and fun make-up.', '2003-11-05 18:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(474417, 44808, 12792, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t feel very original to me, especially stacked up with some of the other submissions.  For what it''s worth, I do like the composition and the lighting.<br/> <br/>Good luck!<br/></td>', 'Doesn''t feel very original to me, especially stacked up with some of the other submissions.  For what it''s worth, I do like the composition and the lighting. Good luck!', '2003-11-05 18:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(474419, 44809, 12792, '<td valign="top">Interesting... Is that a chocker chain?  Fun idea and very nice execution.</td>', 'Interesting... Is that a chocker chain?  Fun idea and very nice execution.', '2003-11-05 18:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(474421, 44707, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice pumpkin.  Was this a natural pumpkin (it looks like it).  If so, that''s one heck of a carving job!   <br/>Your image shows the handwork very well, and the burning (no pun) of the flame causes an interesting effect.   Good work!</td>', 'Nice pumpkin.  Was this a natural pumpkin (it looks like it).  If so, that''s one heck of a carving job!   Your image shows the handwork very well, and the burning (no pun) of the flame causes an interesting effect.   Good work!', '2003-11-05 18:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(474426, 44654, 12792, '<td valign="top">OK, spill it!   T... now this one has me REALY wigged out.  Is this a cake... a guy that was slimed in a Vaseline factory accident... or what?  I really want to know.<br/> <br/>To business... Good Composition, lighting is a bit stark but it really contributes to the quality of the image.  A more finished or professional look wouldn''t have worked so well.   Great work and great answer to the "challenge"!<br/></td>', 'OK, spill it!   T... now this one has me REALY wigged out.  Is this a cake... a guy that was slimed in a Vaseline factory accident... or what?  I really want to know. To business... Good Composition, lighting is a bit stark but it really contributes to the quality of the image.  A more finished or professional look wouldn''t have worked so well.   Great work and great answer to the "challenge"!', '2003-11-05 18:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(474427, 44838, 12792, '<td valign="top">Image is well colored and contrast is good.   The theme is on, but it doesn''t seem to have the effort that others have put into their work.  Good luck though.</td>', 'Image is well colored and contrast is good.   The theme is on, but it doesn''t seem to have the effort that others have put into their work.  Good luck though.', '2003-11-05 18:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(474434, 44819, 12792, '<td valign="top">May be I''m missing something, but for me, the content doesn''t quite meet the challenge subject.   This could be any night.<br/> <br/>That said, the balance is nice and the eerie blue beneath red in the sky is otherworldly.  I also like the fact that the foreground is out of focus to an extent.  The combination of the focus and the feeling that the image is out of balance slightly (feels heavier on the right) gives me a slightly off center -- have to tilt my head to make the world seem right.. feeling.<br/> <br/>Good work.<br/></td>', 'May be I''m missing something, but for me, the content doesn''t quite meet the challenge subject.   This could be any night. That said, the balance is nice and the eerie blue beneath red in the sky is otherworldly.  I also like the fact that the foreground is out of focus to an extent.  The combination of the focus and the feeling that the image is out of balance slightly (feels heavier on the right) gives me a slightly off center -- have to tilt my head to make the world seem right.. feeling. Good work.', '2003-11-05 18:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(474435, 44810, 12792, '<td valign="top">Good thought, but not as much effort as I''ve seen from others.  Sorry and good luck.</td>', 'Good thought, but not as much effort as I''ve seen from others.  Sorry and good luck.', '2003-11-05 18:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(474437, 44658, 12792, '<td valign="top">I''m dating myself, but Mr. Bill would be proud!</td>', 'I''m dating myself, but Mr. Bill would be proud!', '2003-11-05 18:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
