(477098, 44819, 811, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. <br/> <br/>About the focus -- actually the shot is fairly much in focus, on the original.  In Paint Shop Pro, at "1", the file size was like 158, so I bumped it one and it came down to under 150.  However, it blurred when I looked at it after submitting -- thus the multiple submissions.  A few minutes after the deadline, I realized, I probably could have just trimmed a few pixels off of each side, and wouldn''t have had to compress it at all.<br/>DUH!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  About the focus -- actually the shot is fairly much in focus, on the original.  In Paint Shop Pro, at "1", the file size was like 158, so I bumped it one and it came down to under 150.  However, it blurred when I looked at it after submitting -- thus the multiple submissions.  A few minutes after the deadline, I realized, I probably could have just trimmed a few pixels off of each side, and wouldn''t have had to compress it at all.DUH!', '2003-11-08 00:34:43.000000', NULL, 0),
