(477543, 44672, 6388, '<td valign="top">Great job JD.  This was one of three I gave an 8 to on this challenge.  As I said before - the lighting in amazing....even if it was only one take :)<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'Great job JD.  This was one of three I gave an 8 to on this challenge.  As I said before - the lighting in amazing....even if it was only one take :) Pedro', '2003-11-08 18:00:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(477643, 44829, 10084, '<td valign="top">I know I ranting on the blue light thing, but I do think it works in this shot. The black mixed with the black lit web works nicely together. The black light really helps to give it a vivid, vibrant glow that gives you that "Halloween" feeling. Clubbing also :P.<br/> <br/>The tiny blue border works with the framing choice. The web actually reminds me of lightening. <br/> <br/>If I could have voted I would''ve definitely gave you a "10" on this shot.</td>', 'I know I ranting on the blue light thing, but I do think it works in this shot. The black mixed with the black lit web works nicely together. The black light really helps to give it a vivid, vibrant glow that gives you that "Halloween" feeling. Clubbing also :P. The tiny blue border works with the framing choice. The web actually reminds me of lightening.  If I could have voted I would''ve definitely gave you a "10" on this shot.', '2003-11-08 20:42:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(477736, 44827, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Especially good job on the ears and teeth!  I''d like to see the original pic... please post it.<br/> <br/><br/><i>  I found your original image...  Great initial image, the yellowish lighting, dark clothes, and facial expression made this one come out really good!<br/>[edit]Message edited by author 2003-11-08 23:08:48.</i></td>', 'Very cool.  Especially good job on the ears and teeth!  I''d like to see the original pic... please post it.   I found your original image...  Great initial image, the yellowish lighting, dark clothes, and facial expression made this one come out really good![edit]', '2003-11-08 22:57:45.000000', '2003-11-08 23:08:48.000000', 0),
